WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.600
A quick trick for case maths: compound growth.

2
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:11.022
Revenue: $100M → $121M in 2 years. Growth per year?

3
00:00:11.172 --> 00:00:16.244
+21% in total, but it compounds

4
00:00:16.344 --> 00:00:20.124
1.1 × 1.1

5
00:00:20.224 --> 00:00:22.748
= 1.21

6
00:00:22.848 --> 00:00:24.922
10% a year

7
00:00:25.072 --> 00:00:29.984
Guess a round rate, test it, and adjust. Interviewers love seeing the check.
